  "id": "sweet-potato-crunch",
  "name": "Sweet Potato Crunch",
  "subtitle": "Creamy sweet potatoes beneath a crisp coconut-pecan topping",
  "description": "A warm American side dish combining smooth sweet potatoes with a buttery, nutty topping.",
